  "content": "<div class=\"p-10 font-sans max-w-4xl mx-auto border border-neutral-300 rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm border-t-4 border-emerald-500\">\n  <div class=\"text-center border-b-2 border-neutral-800 pb-6 mb-8\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-serif font-black text-neutral-900 uppercase tracking-tight\">PROPOSTA COMERCIAL E PLANO DE TRABALHO B2B</h1>\n    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 font-mono mt-2 tracking-widest\">DILIGÊNCIA COMERCIAL PARA PARCERIAS DE ALTA PERFORMANCE</p>\n    <div class=\"mt-3 flex justify-center\">\n      <span class=\"text-[8px] uppercase font-mono bg-neutral-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 font-bold\">\n        SUB-MÓDULO: FINANCEIRO • ID: proposta-comercial-vendas\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-6 text-neutral-850 leading-relaxed text-sm text-justify\">\n    <p>Encaminhada sob a rubrica executiva da proponente à contratante.</p>\n    <div class=\"border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden my-4\">\n      <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-b border-neutral-200 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase text-neutral-600\">\n            <th class=\"p-3 font-bold\">Módulo Sugerido</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3 font-bold\">Horas Estimadas</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3 font-bold\">Investimento</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"border-b border-neutral-150 hover:bg-neutral-50/50\">\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-neutral-850\">Arquitetura Cloud S/A</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-neutral-600\">40 horas</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-neutral-600\">R$ {{preco_arquitetura}}</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"border-b border-neutral-150 hover:bg-neutral-50/50\">\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-neutral-850\">Integração Hub Plataforma</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-neutral-600\">80 horas</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-neutral-600\">R$ {{preco_integracao}}</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-base font-serif font-bold text-neutral-900 border-b border-neutral-250 pt-4 pb-1 uppercase tracking-tight\">ORIENTAÇÃO COMERCIAL</h2>\n      <p>Proponente: {{empresa_proponente}}, CNPJ {{proponente_cnpj}} | Destinatária: {{empresa_destinataria}}, CNPJ {{destinataria_cnpj}} | Prazo de validade da proposta: até {{validade_data}}.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-12 mt-16 text-center text-[11px] page-break-inside-avoid\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n      <div class=\"border-t border-neutral-400 w-full pt-1.5\"></div>\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-neutral-950\">{{empresa_proponente}}</p>\n      <p class=\"text-neutral-500 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider\">REPRESENTANTE PROPONENTE</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
